# Sunny Upside Down — optional configuration
#
# 1. Copy this file:   cp .env.example .env
# 2. Fill in what you want. Everything here is OPTIONAL — the app runs fully
#    without any keys, using its built-in shadow engine and free OSM services.
# 3. `.env` is git-ignored, so your keys never leave your machine.

# ShadeMap API key — unlocks the shadow engine behind shademap.app
# (GPU shadows that also include terrain: hills, not just buildings).
# Free key, email signup: https://shademap.app/about
# You can also paste this key in the app itself via the ⚙️ button.
SHADEMAP_API_KEY=
